{"seq":4,"slug":"background-jobs-async","title":"后台任务与异步处理","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async","rating":{"composite":3.35,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 后台任务与异步处理 简介\n\n把耗时、不可靠或可延迟的工作从请求-响应的同步路径剥离出来，是后端服务保持快与稳的关键。本 hub 面向需要构建可靠后台任务系统的工程师，从异步处理的基础（为什么需要后台任务、同步/异步边界、任务队列解剖）讲起，覆盖工作队列与 worker、调度与延迟任务、优先级与公平等队列模式，重试退避、死信队列、幂等消费者等可靠性保证，以及 worker 伸缩、监控告警、毒丸消息等运维实践。贯穿全篇的可靠基线是：at-least-once 投递 + 幂等消费 + 有界重试 + 死信兜底 + 监控告警。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"async-fundamentals","title":"Async Fundamentals","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-background-jobs","title":"为什么需要后台任务","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/why-background-jobs","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-vs-async-boundaries","title":"同步与异步的边界","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/sync-vs-async-boundaries","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"job-queue-anatomy","title":"任务队列的解剖","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/job-queue-anatomy","wordCount":1459,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章建立异步处理的基础：先论证为什么要把耗时、不可靠、可延迟的工作移出同步路径，再讲清同步与异步的职责边界如何划分及如何向用户表达最终一致性，最后解剖任务队列的组成与确认/持久化语义——这是用好任何队列工具的前提。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"queue-patterns","title":"Queue Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-queues-and-workers","title":"任务队列与工作进程","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns/task-queues-and-workers","wordCount":1552,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"scheduling-and-delayed-jobs","title":"调度与延迟任务","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns/scheduling-and-delayed-jobs","wordCount":1586,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"priority-and-fairness","title":"优先级与公平性","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns/priority-and-fairness","wordCount":1496,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章讨论队列模式：工作进程的拉取模型与工作队列/发布订阅两种分发语义、按类型优先级分队列的拓扑，延迟任务与分布式 cron 的调度及其错过补偿，以及优先级与公平调度如何在重要任务优先与防止低优先级饥饿之间取舍。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reliability","title":"Reliability","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/reliability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retries-and-backoff","title":"重试与退避","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/reliability/retries-and-backoff","wordCount":1549,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"dead-letter-queues","title":"死信队列","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/reliability/dead-letter-queues","wordCount":1566,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotent-consumers","title":"幂等消费者","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/reliability/idempotent-consumers","wordCount":1775,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章是后台任务的可靠性核心：区分瞬时与持久失败的有界重试、指数退避与抖动，把无法成功的任务隔离保全的死信队列，以及在 at-least-once 投递下消化重复执行的幂等消费者。三者配合构成「任务不丢、可安全重试」的可靠基线。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"operating-jobs","title":"Operating Jobs","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/operating-jobs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"worker-scaling-concurrency","title":"工作进程伸缩与并发","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/operating-jobs/worker-scaling-concurrency","wordCount":1528,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-and-observability","title":"监控与可观测性","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/operating-jobs/monitoring-and-observability","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"poison-messages-and-failures","title":"毒丸消息与故障处理","url":"/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/operating-jobs/poison-messages-and-failures","wordCount":1721,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章关注任务运维：worker 的并发模型与按积压自动伸缩及其下游资源约束、把后台黑盒变透明的关键指标与追踪告警，以及毒丸消息的防护与更广义的故障姿态——让系统在崩溃、抖动、中断、毒丸下仍不丢、不卡、可恢复。\n"}]}